From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:51:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(settings): Script Execution (CRUD, editor 3.000
 baris, jalankan di Molina Terminal)

- ScriptStore: simpanan JSON atomik + StateFlow, upsert dari editor, batas 50 skrip
- Halaman Settings > Script execution: accordion judul/catatan/isi, tambah, ubah, hapus, salin
- ScriptRunner: tulis skrip ke /root/.molina/scripts di Debian, ketik chmod +x + Enter ke sesi Molina Terminal (aktif atau baru), pindah ke tab Terminal
- Dialog konfirmasi sebelum menjalankan; indeks pencarian Settings diperbarui
